
# ===== OpenRouter API Keys =====
# Get your key at https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys
# Real OpenRouter keys look like: sk-or-v1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# The config reads UnoRouter first, then UnoRouter1, then OPENROUTER_API_KEY.

UnoRouter=sk-or-v1-your_openrouter_key_here
UnoRouter1=

